    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, thanks. Just to be sure I'm not missing anything, is there any other way we should be looking at the value loss over time? Like, are there any common errors or things people usually overlook when they're tracking how an asset's value drops off?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
